      en: ["{a.first} has passed away. At the funeral, a pallbearer slips on a dead leaf. The casket tumbles down the church steps, pops open, and {a.first} ends up sitting against the holy water font. The dentures land in Aunt Monica's hat.", "{a.first}'s burial. As the casket is lowered, a strap snaps. BOOM. The lid flies off, {a.first} gives the crowd one last involuntary wave, and Uncle Bernard faints into the hole."],
