      en: ["Scandal at the residence: the nurse caught you with {a.first} in the linen closet, 'stress-testing' a towel cart. There are dentures on the floor. Two sets.", "Your hospital bed raised itself in the middle of the night, with you and {a.first} in it, setting off the alarm. The entire night shift burst in. The residence has gossip for the next ten years."],
