      en: ["Mr. Brown, your notary, hands you a pen. 'It's time to write your will. Who gets what?' {a.first} is waiting in the hallway, acting casual. Very casual.", "You're writing your will. {a.first} brought you flowers and chocolates and called three times this week. Surely a coincidence."],
