      en: ["The annual bingo final. You and Germaine are one number away. 'Eighty-nine!' Germaine stands to yell bingo… and collapses face-first into the quiche. She isn't moving. Her card is full.", "Bingo final, total silence. Germaine, your rival, lets out one last 'BIN…' and drops dead on her card. The 'GO' never comes. The caller looks at you."],
